# ==============================================================================
# Arch Linux Custom OS — Package Manifest (packages.x86_64)
# Multi-GPU: Full AMD Radeon + Intel + NVIDIA Hybrid Support
# Desktops: GNOME + Hyprland (with HyDE / Kartik dotfiles)
# Audio: PipeWire + Bluetooth HiFi Codecs
# Installer: Calamares GUI Installer & Archinstall
# ==============================================================================

